    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood and related symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling “bit flat” for the last couple of months, not all day every day. Still enjoys footy; otherwise says “can’t be bothered”. Sleep is broken by night observations and medications. Appetite is okay; staff report no weight loss. No increased anxiety. Passive thoughts that it “wouldn’t matter if I didn’t wake up”; denies active suicidal ideation or plan and says “I wouldn’t do anything silly, just sick of being here”."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Medication memory and adherence"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports increased forgetfulness about medications: “I keep forgetting… sometimes I just say I’ve had them so they’ll go away”. RACF chart documents multiple refusals of metoprolol this month. At 16:30 on 22/11/25, RN reported that the patient took all morning medications that day after discussion, saying “I’ll give it a go for a bit”."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cardiovascular and respiratory symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No chest pain or palpitations. Mild postural lightheadedness only if getting up too quickly; no syncope. Baseline mild dyspnoea on exertion. No oedema."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Physical examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks thin but in no acute distress, sitting in a chair. Pacemaker site well healed. Heart sounds dual; no oedema. Chest clear."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
